            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "In assembling this issue, we were struck by how often the stories converged on a single theme: the tension between what is measurable and what matters. The data we present in these pages is rigorous, but the questions it raises are ultimately human, and it is in that space, between the quantified and the qualitative, that the most interesting work is being done. We are grateful to the researchers, practitioners, and thinkers who shared their time, and to you, our readers, whose engagement is the reason any of this work finds its way into print."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                63,
                51,
                484,
                230
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Coming Next Issue"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                244,
                263,
                262
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Next issue, we turn our attention to the question of scale, examining how ideas, technologies, and movements grow from experiments into institutions, and what is gained and lost in that transition. We will report from field sites and laboratories, profile practitioners working at the frontier, and convene a roundtable of scholars to debate where the most consequential transformations are underway. Sub-"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                63,
                265,
                485,
                395
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "scribe to ensure you do not miss it."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                51,
                801,
                67
            ]
        },
        {
